{"parse": {"title": "8TH-22", "pageid": 69786, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-21\" title=\"8TH-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">8TH-22</span><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-23\" title=\"8TH-23\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">8TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">22</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A5.BF.E9.A3.8E.E5.92.86.E5.93.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"西风咆哮\">西风咆哮</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 西风咆哮</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Roaring Forties</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>夏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>结<span class=\"color-value\"></span>束<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>始<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10822</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_xifenghaiya\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_xifenghaiya\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-516020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您做出了正确的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我们都为了祂的指引而来，传道者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>很遗憾，那个魅魔没能带过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>但我想，你会需要这个，还有兀尔德女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-516010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-516010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-516010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>不，将军，不是“你”，而是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_yuantiao\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_yuantiao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_yuantiao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>我们都需要祂降下的奇迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我的部下不会戴上那面具。他们也不会接受试炼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>不需要用试炼来试探我麾下孩子们的忠诚，传道者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>兀尔德女士暂时由我保护。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>如您所愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传道者对老将军提出的要求一一承应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无妨，都无妨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她远眺南方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传道者·苏菲亚：</div><div>下次见，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传道者接过复苏之母留在世上的痕迹，与将军道别离开。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_xifenghaiya\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_xifenghaiya\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>父亲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我对洛佩拉开枪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>开枪是一回事，但子弹射向了心脏还是大地，又是另一回事。但对老将军来说，这都不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>坦白说，对您的选择，至少从个人层面讲，父亲，我并不完全认同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>你可以保留意见，也可以不认同，中尉，我需要的不是这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>而是服从。我明白，父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>您一开始就认为洛佩拉不会跟我们走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>那孩子无关紧要。她解决了自己惹出的麻烦，从兄弟会的闹剧里带回了兀尔德，这就够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>但兄弟会……恕我直言，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我听说他们也和重塑之手……的“朋友”有联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她很难说服自己改变称呼，将昔日与之对抗的敌人称作“朋友”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>变节是难以洗刷的耻辱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我原本以为你会和她做出同样的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>不，我会追随您，父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>随她去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落单的海鸟滑过晴空，鸣叫着，朝温暖的北方飞去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军拍拍女儿肩上的军徽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>带德洛丝医生过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>副官女士带来盲眼医生，随后沉默地离开海崖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>我不认识您。您认错人了，将军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>不，我不可能会认错你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>老朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>在千禧年到来前的最后那几天，我们曾并肩作战。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>往事从老人锈迹斑斑的记忆殿堂里涌出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>长远来看，那或许是一次错误的行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>“暴雨”到来，留下混乱的时代与失去父亲的孤儿们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我们失去了未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军从不为牺牲动容，因为一切乃是为了胜利与更宏大的目标所必不可少的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>但现在，或许可以走上另一条路，一条我们曾经拼尽一切反对的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>阿尔卡纳指引的道路——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>一条，让世界不再有纷争的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>我的老朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很遗憾，这些话语中的哪怕是支离破碎的半点信息她都无法理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只是无国界医生德洛丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>基金会送给你的那张白色大理石凳上有什么秘密？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-516411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>那个按钮按下后，你又感受到了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>什么也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-516401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>你还记得，曾经走进一间白色房子后发生的事情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>抱歉，将军，我对此一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她有些倔强，但却愿意以诚实回应老将军的诚实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老将军叹了口气，随即抽出大衣里的一叠杂志——尽管他本人并非《UTTU》的读者，也对此毫无兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>敬爱的兀尔德女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>你的名字穿过了一场又一场雨幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>但我始终不知道你究竟遇到了什么，又经历过什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔将军：</div><div>——但你的存在，即将改变我们所有人的命运。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "8TH-22"}}